Problem:

xdpr|lpr on Ultrix 4.3 RISC with an LN03S printer produces unscaled output,
always in portrait orientation.

Cause:

The version of /usr/lib/lpdfilters/ln03of supplied with Ultrix 4.3 pre-empts 
the scaling and orientation escape sequences in the xpr output file.

Solution:

Re-install /usr/lpdfilters/ln03of from the Ultrix 4.2 distribution.

-------------------

DEC TSC were unaware of the problem, and were unable to help because they do 
not have LN03S printers available.

I am submitting an SPR.

