from a current SCU disk for the 433ST?  If not, I will have to
give in to DEC's extortion of a few hundred dollars to get an
upgrade to make the machine work!  I have dialed into one DEC BBS
that I was told of from one of the 800 "support" lines, but there
was little to nothing on it available to the public.

Any help is appreciated to possibly save me a few hundred bucks!

