A lot of the slowness of short user programs on DEC MIPS OSF/1 versus
Ultrix is due to internationalization support.  Making sure that the
locale is C (by setenv LANG C or by editing /etc/nls/native_locale.conf)
can speed things up considerably.  See the man pages for setlocale()
and native_locale.conf.

