well, when the CPU-LEDS stop at 2 that means that the bootloader cannot
find an operation system or boot-block.
I can't remember the relation between the numbers and the tests performed,
I just recall 6 stands for memory-test.
Well, when your terminal isn't displaying anything or just '???', than
