disk (DUA0-3) or on a cluster (XQA0) to boot from. To perform maual boot,
set the toggle-switch on the i/o-panel to the sign with the dot INSIDE the
circle, than no power-on boot will happen. You then can enther '>>> b <device>,
when your console-terminal is working...
Bye then,
