To use a VAXstation as a X-Terminal, you can use the EWS RT Software
(VAXELN Runtime Windowing Software, UPI: YWR)

The performance is much better than running (Open)VMS and MOTIF.
But as far a I know, EWS V1.2 uses X11R2, which might give problems with some
applications. Additionally, EWS is not supporting the INFOserver.

I heard of EWS V2.0 (supporting X11R3 or X11R4) a year ago, but nothing
happened so far.

But I never heard of a VAXstation running VXT X-Terminal Software.
If someone could mail me his experiencies.

-Peter
